    "updated_at": "2021-04-14T09:44:53Z",
    "body": "The `cmd_duration` is handled by the shell\r\nMeaning that it's probably a 'feature' of powershell\r\nNo reset of the command duration environment variable (which starship reads to get it's command duration information) when running empty commands was explicitly requested for fish shell in this [issue](https://github.com/fish-shell/fish-shell/issues/4926) for example.",
